  "text": "TzKal-Zuk CA\n\nNote: This guide will go over how to complete the Combat achievements for Zuk, and assumes you are already familiar with the basic mechanics of the encounter which can be found here #tzkal-zuk-basic\nPreset\n⬥ Necromancy | Ful of Energy \n​\n\nFul of Energy But Nowhere To Go\n⬥ Defeat TzKal-Zuk in hard mode in a single run without moving after attacking the 'Conduit of Ful' in wave 18.\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• You are allowed to move after the conduit has spawned, just not after you have started attacking it\n​\nPhasing Zuk at 100k HP: Make sure to be at full health, max  and \n​\nConduit 1:  +  →  →  →  +  →  →  → \n​\nConduit 2:  +  →  → ( switch)  +  →  →  →  \n​\nConduit 3:  +  →  →  →  →  →  →  →  →  →  → \n​\nConduit 4:  +  →  →  →  →  → \n​\nConduit 5:  +  →  →  →  +  →  →  →  →  →  →  → improv\n​\n​\nNotes:\n⬥ Make sure to have the  perk\n⬥ Make sure to not move\n⬥ Eat as necessary\nExample Kills\n Necromancy\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "TzKal-Zuk CA Note: This guide will go over how to complete the Combat achievements for Zuk, and assumes you are already familiar with the basic mechanics of the encounter which can be found here #tzkal-zuk-basic Preset ⬥ Necromancy | Ful of Energy ​ Ful of Energy But Nowhere To Go ⬥ Defeat TzKal-Zuk in hard mode in a single run without moving after attacking the 'Conduit of Ful' in wave 18. ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• You are allowed to move after the conduit has spawned, just not after you have started attacking it ​ Phasing Zuk at 100k HP: Make sure to be at full health, max and ​ Conduit 1: + → → → + → → → ​ Conduit 2: + → → ( switch) + → → → ​ Conduit 3: + → → → → → → → → → → ​ Conduit 4: + → → → → → ​ Conduit 5: + → → → + → → → → → → → improv ​ ​ Notes: ⬥ Make sure to have the perk ⬥ Make sure to not move ⬥ Eat as necessary Example Kills Necromancy",
